WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:11.160
For many years, you have been the Chancellor
of the Pontifical Academy of Social Sciences.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:19.560
Why do you take the Social Sciences as part
of the Vatican, and what is your ambition

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:25.860
with this academy, which became famous to
the world when, not that long ago, you invited

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:31.600
Bernie Sanders to be one of your guests to
speak about ecology?

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:44.900
The new Academy of Social Sciences, created in 1994, worked very well, especially  in a theoretical way.

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:51.340
It studied the problem of globalization, it
studied the problem of war.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:01:00.980
It studied the problem of religion and the
new sciences and many very interesting things.

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:04.760
But it was more theoretical.

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:14.280
When Francis became Pope, he asked the Academy,
he asked me: please study the problem of the

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:23.300
new forms of slavery, of human trafficking
and the trafficking of organs, of organized

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:32.300
crime, the question of narcotics - very complicated
things.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:40.680
We accepted this challenge, and we studied
these important subjects for the past three

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.180
years.

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:43.729
We organized many meetings.

00:01:43.729 --> 00:01:46.319
Now, we understand many things.

00:01:46.319 --> 00:01:54.399
The first thing is that it is very important
that the religions work together in defense

00:01:54.399 --> 00:02:01.159
of human dignity and freedom, especially against
these new forms of slaves, of which today

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:06.260
there are 40 million.

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:19.380
The pope came here, we invited the most important
religious leaders, and the message was: these

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:24.330
new forms of slavery are a crime against humanity.

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:31.170
We need to work together, we can pray together,
because even if there are different ideas

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:36.989
about God, God is only one.

00:02:36.989 --> 00:02:43.160
Anyway, we can - and need to - work and act
together to defend human dignity.

